WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.300
Following a false start, the long-anticipated moment

2
00:00:05.366 --> 00:00:07.400
of Ash's Gym Battle against Clemont

3
00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:11.133
at the Lumiose City Gym has finally arrived!

4
00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:20.933
- 'Kay, let's do this for real!
- Pikachu.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.300
- I'm all set.
- You'll be great.

6
00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:25.433
And this time, there's no stopping you!

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.333
So lots of luck to both of you!

8
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.833
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

9
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.333
I'm Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town!

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.900
I've come here to win my Lumiose City Gym Badge!

11
00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:38.000
Your battle was confirmed some time ago.

12
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.700
I'm all set to go.

13
00:00:41.766 --> 00:00:46.033
- Yes. Shall we do this?
- I'm ready for you, Ash!

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

15
00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:55.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

16
00:00:55.633 --> 00:00:59.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

17
00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:00.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

18
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

19
00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:07.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

20
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

21
00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:15.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

22
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:19.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

23
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

24
00:01:24.766 --> 00:01:27.500
The Moment of Lumiose Truth!

25
00:01:36.233 --> 00:01:39.900
Now. Come on out, Braixen and Pancham.

26
00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.966
- Brai!
- Pan.

27
00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.833
- Dedenne too!
- Ne! Denne.

28
00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.666
Make sure you cheer for Ash and Clemont.

29
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.566
- Braix!
- Cham!

30
00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:50.833
Che. Chespin, pin.

31
00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.833
Che. Chespin.

32
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.800
- Huh. You're not battling, Chespin?
- Chespin, pin.

33
00:01:56.866 --> 00:01:59.833
Then you can cheer with all of us!

34
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.400
Chespin, Chespin!

35
00:02:02.466 --> 00:02:05.400
- Looks like I made it in time.
- Daddy?

36
00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:07.000
- You came?
- It's Meyer!

37
00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:10.466
I wanted to see what kind of Gym Leader my boy is.

38
00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:14.066
Now, Ash! I want you to give my son everything you've got!

39
00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:17.233
Show me some honest-to-goodness fireworks out there!

40
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.800
Right! You bet I will!

41
00:02:19.866 --> 00:02:21.866
I appreciate that, Ash!

42
00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:24.566
- Hold onto your hat, Dad!
- Hm.

43
00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:28.133
But don't forget. I'm gonna win that Lumiose Gym Badge!

44
00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.700
Pika!

45
00:02:29.766 --> 00:02:32.666
Don't forget, since I left, I've been training too!

46
00:02:32.733 --> 00:02:36.700
This won't be a walk in the park. That's one thing you can count on.

47
00:02:36.766 --> 00:02:40.433
You'll never forget this battle. And you can count on that too!

48
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:44.666
Clembot. I'd like you to act as referee.

49
00:02:44.733 --> 00:02:48.533
The Lumiose Gym Battle between Ash and Clemont will now begin!

50
00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.133
This will be a three-on-three match,

51
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.666
and the battle will be over when all three of either trainer's Pokémon

52
00:02:53.733 --> 00:02:56.666
are unable to continue.

53
00:02:56.733 --> 00:03:00.566
Only the challenger will be allowed to make substitutions during the match.

54
00:03:00.633 --> 00:03:03.766
And now, bring out your first Pokémon!

55
00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:07.633
We're all ready, so here it is.

56
00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.566
Go, Bunnelby!

57
00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:14.133
- Bunn.
- Huh? Bunnelby, huh?

58
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.566
- All right. Pikachu, you're up!
- Pikachu!

59
00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:19.500
Bunnelby against Pikachu.

60
00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:22.066
That's quite a match-up to start out with.

61
00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:28.100
- And now, battle begin!
- Ash! Here's to a good battle!

62
00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:31.200
Right! There'll be no holding back!

63
00:03:33.366 --> 00:03:36.133
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

64
00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.466
Pikachu!

65
00:03:39.533 --> 00:03:41.400
Make a dust cloud with your ears, Bunnelby!

66
00:03:41.466 --> 00:03:43.133
Bunnelby!

67
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.933
- Pika!
- Oh, my, well done!

68
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.233
Now, Bunnelby, use Dig!

69
00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.733
Bunnelby!

70
00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:53.733
Humph.

71
00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:57.166
Pikachu, run and don't let Bunnelby track you!

72
00:03:57.233 --> 00:03:59.000
- Pika!
- Now, Bunnelby!

73
00:03:59.066 --> 00:04:01.500
By! -Pika!

74
00:04:01.566 --> 00:04:03.733
- Pika...
- Bunn!

75
00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.500
- Wait, isn't this...
- All right, Pikachu, Quick Attack!

76
00:04:07.566 --> 00:04:09.833
Pikachu! Pi, pi, pika!

77
00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.166
Bunn! Bunn!

78
00:04:12.233 --> 00:04:14.566
Bunn!

79
00:04:14.633 --> 00:04:17.600
-Bunnelby, Double Slap!

80
00:04:17.666 --> 00:04:20.399
- Bunnelby! Bunnelby!
- Pika! Pika!

81
00:04:20.466 --> 00:04:23.766
- Pika! Pi...
- Bunn!

82
00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:27.166
- Iron Tail, let's go!
- Pikachu! Pika!

83
00:04:27.233 --> 00:04:29.300
Bunnelby, catch it with your ears!

84
00:04:29.366 --> 00:04:31.266
- Pika!
- Bunn!

85
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:33.766
- Pikachu!
- Incredible!

86
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:37.500
Oh, right. I totally forgot you weren't there back then.

87
00:04:37.566 --> 00:04:39.333
- Huh?
- They're the same moves.

88
00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.233
Yup! The same ones Ash and Clemont used in their battle

89
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.933
when we first met.

90
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.733
Of course, Team Rocket made trouble, so they had to stop.

91
00:04:49.766 --> 00:04:52.733
So is this battle like a continuation of that one?

92
00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:54.666
You could put it that way.

93
00:04:54.733 --> 00:04:58.533
Now that I think of it, this Gym Battle did start that first day.

94
00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.600
I had a feeling this might happen.

95
00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:05.200
Well, you did manage to escape with that Electro Ball back then.

96
00:05:05.266 --> 00:05:07.266
But it won't happen this time!

97
00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:08.933
Use Wild Charge!

98
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.833
- Bunnelby!
- Pikachu!

99
00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.333
- Bunn!
- Pika!

100
00:05:13.766 --> 00:05:16.200
- Pika!
- Pikachu!

101
00:05:17.433 --> 00:05:20.066
- Now use Dig!
- Brrrrr!

102
00:05:20.133 --> 00:05:22.066
- What?
- Pika!

103
00:05:22.133 --> 00:05:25.300
- Look at that! That's interesting.
- What?

104
00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:28.800
You see, Wild Charge is a move that causes recoil damage.

105
00:05:28.866 --> 00:05:30.800
By using Dig right after Wild Charge,

106
00:05:30.866 --> 00:05:33.800
it avoids a counter-attack when taking that damage.

107
00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:36.700
So Clemont planned it as a combination?

108
00:05:36.766 --> 00:05:39.700
- Wow, Clemont. That's cool.
- Pikachu, be careful!

109
00:05:39.766 --> 00:05:41.733
- Here it comes!
- Pika!

110
00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.266
- Brrrrr!
- Pika!

111
00:05:44.166 --> 00:05:46.500
- Pi! Pika.
- Bunn!

112
00:05:46.566 --> 00:05:48.000
Nice strategy, Clemont.

113
00:05:48.066 --> 00:05:51.933
He wasn't kidding when he said he's done a lot of training

114
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.233
since he came back home.

115
00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.766
I've thought about strategy a lot.

116
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:01.200
I know what I need in order to take on Ash and his unpredictable battling style.

117
00:06:01.266 --> 00:06:04.600
It's all about analysis and planning.

118
00:06:04.666 --> 00:06:07.300
This is about much more than victory for me.

119
00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:10.033
I want to bring out the best in all my challengers!

120
00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:13.166
Right. Then I'm gonna show you my very best now!

121
00:06:13.233 --> 00:06:16.366
- Pikachu, use Quick Attack!
- Pi, pi, pi!

122
00:06:16.433 --> 00:06:18.433
- Dig, let's go!
- Brrrrr!

123
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.266
- Use Iron Tail! Slam it on the ground!
- Pikachu!

124
00:06:21.333 --> 00:06:23.933
Pika, pika!

125
00:06:24.766 --> 00:06:25.933
Bunn!

126
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.866
- Now, Iron Tail one more time!
- Pikachu!

127
00:06:29.933 --> 00:06:32.000
Bunn! Bunn!

128
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.200
- Bunnelby.
- Bunnelby!

129
00:06:36.266 --> 00:06:38.666
Bunnelby is unable to battle.

130
00:06:38.733 --> 00:06:41.166
- Pikachu is the winner!
- All right!

131
00:06:41.233 --> 00:06:43.200
- Pikachu!
- That was amazing!

132
00:06:43.266 --> 00:06:45.633
Aw, I feel bad for Bunnelby.

133
00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.766
Now, Bunnelby, return!

134
00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.200
Well done, Bunnelby. Thank you!

135
00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.800
- We got the first one.
- Pikachu.

136
00:06:55.866 --> 00:06:58.533
- But now, things are really gonna heat up!
- Pika!

137
00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.266
- Ash looks like he's having a great time!
- Mm!

138
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:03.966
He's been looking forward to this for a long time!

139
00:07:04.033 --> 00:07:05.966
- Pancham! Pancham!
- Che, che!

140
00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:08.866
Here's Pokémon number two. Come on out!

141
00:07:10.733 --> 00:07:12.366
He!

142
00:07:12.433 --> 00:07:16.300
- OK. Heliolisk. Pikachu, return!
- Pikachu.

143
00:07:19.466 --> 00:07:21.700
All right, I choose you!

144
00:07:23.866 --> 00:07:25.366
Goo!

145
00:07:25.433 --> 00:07:27.866
A-ha! So Goodra is your second Pokémon.

146
00:07:27.933 --> 00:07:30.600
- Dra!
- It's gotten really strong.

147
00:07:30.666 --> 00:07:32.666
-Go for it, Goodra and Heliolisk!

148
00:07:32.733 --> 00:07:34.300
- Good luck!
- OK, Heliolisk.

149
00:07:34.366 --> 00:07:37.266
- You're going to have to really focus, OK?
- Heli!

150
00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:40.700
Now, Goodra. Go! Dragon Pulse!

151
00:07:40.766 --> 00:07:42.733
Goodra!

152
00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.233
Heliolisk, get moving!

153
00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.233
Heli, heli, Heliolisk! Lisk!

154
00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.733
- Hm? Dra?
- Lisk! Lisk!

155
00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.166
Heliolisk's moving differently than before!

156
00:07:53.233 --> 00:07:55.400
- I'm getting dizzy. Ah.
- Goodra!

157
00:07:55.466 --> 00:07:59.466
I warn you, you can't possibly deal with my Heliolisk's incredible speed!

158
00:07:59.533 --> 00:08:02.566
- Dra.
- Use Flash!

159
00:08:02.633 --> 00:08:04.433
-Goo! Goodra!

160
00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.000
- What?
- Now, Dragon Tail!

161
00:08:07.133 --> 00:08:09.366
Heliolisk!

162
00:08:09.433 --> 00:08:13.100
Dra!

163
00:08:14.566 --> 00:08:17.000
- Pika!

164
00:08:17.066 --> 00:08:19.366
Who's that Pokémon?

165
00:08:24.066 --> 00:08:26.333
It's Goodra!

166
00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.533
Goodra!

167
00:08:31.433 --> 00:08:33.333
-Denne!

168
00:08:35.366 --> 00:08:37.799
-Goodra, you OK?

169
00:08:37.866 --> 00:08:39.500
Goodra!

170
00:08:39.566 --> 00:08:42.500
Yes! Let's go. Use Dragon Pulse!

171
00:08:42.566 --> 00:08:43.666
Goo!

172
00:08:43.733 --> 00:08:46.666
Heliolisk. Knock Goodra off balance again!

173
00:08:46.733 --> 00:08:49.400
- Heliolisk!
- Goodra!

174
00:08:49.466 --> 00:08:52.000
- Lisk! Lisk! Heliolisk!
- Goo!

175
00:08:52.066 --> 00:08:55.233
- And now, use Thunder Wave!
- He!

176
00:08:55.866 --> 00:08:57.733
Goo!

177
00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.733
- Ah, Goodra!
- Pika!

178
00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.133
Goodra's been paralysed!

179
00:09:02.866 --> 00:09:04.966
Ah. Goodra, return!

180
00:09:05.033 --> 00:09:07.900
Don't worry. You'll get another shot.

181
00:09:07.966 --> 00:09:09.800
So, what will you do now, Ash?

182
00:09:09.866 --> 00:09:13.933
To beat Heliolisk, I've gotta match speed with speed!

183
00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.533
'Kay. I choose you!

184
00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.966
Lucha!

185
00:09:19.033 --> 00:09:21.300
Clever. Now it's a speed battle.

186
00:09:21.366 --> 00:09:23.300
Hawlucha, use Karate Chop!

187
00:09:23.933 --> 00:09:26.833
- Cha!
- Use Thunder Wave again!

188
00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.033
- He!
- Ha, lucha-cha!

189
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.733
Li, lisk!

190
00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.466
Uh! Heliolisk!

191
00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.133
Lucha!

192
00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.500
- All right!
- Oh!

193
00:09:38.566 --> 00:09:42.200
Heliolisk is also a Normal type so it's weak against Fighting-type moves.

194
00:09:42.266 --> 00:09:44.933
- Can you still go on?
- Heli!

195
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.766
- Parabolic Charge!
- Lisk!

196
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:51.966
Helio!

197
00:09:52.033 --> 00:09:54.600
Hawlucha, dodge it!

198
00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:56.766
Ha, ha, ha! Cha!

199
00:09:56.833 --> 00:09:59.600
- Hawlucha!
- Pika!

200
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:02.966
Parabolic Charge is an attack that also heals.

201
00:10:03.033 --> 00:10:06.633
So the damage Heliolisk took is disappearing!

202
00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.433
- We're not done yet! Flying Press!
- Ha!

203
00:10:13.466 --> 00:10:16.766
- Use Flash!
- Heli!

204
00:10:16.833 --> 00:10:19.566
- Cha!
- Now, Parabolic Charge!

205
00:10:19.633 --> 00:10:22.100
- Lisk!
- Ha?

206
00:10:22.166 --> 00:10:25.033
- Helio!
- Cha!

207
00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.533
Hawlucha!

208
00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:29.533
Heli!

209
00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.966
Hold on.

210
00:10:33.566 --> 00:10:35.200
Ah. Got it!

211
00:10:37.666 --> 00:10:38.666
- Lisk!
- Cha?

212
00:10:38.733 --> 00:10:41.766
- Hawlucha! I think I found an opening!
- Ha?

213
00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:44.633
- Use Flash once again!
- Now lure it in!

214
00:10:45.733 --> 00:10:48.633
- He!
- All right, Hawlucha, High Jump Kick!

215
00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.566
Cha! Lucha!

216
00:10:51.733 --> 00:10:53.433
-Pika!

217
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.900
- Heli...
- Heliolisk is unable to battle.

218
00:10:55.966 --> 00:10:57.233
Hawlucha is the winner!

219
00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.366
- Wow. Hawlucha's strong!
- Yay, Ash! Way to go!

220
00:11:00.433 --> 00:11:03.800
- Those sparks are flyin' now.
- That's two Pokémon!

221
00:11:03.866 --> 00:11:05.066
- Cha?
- Pika!

222
00:11:05.133 --> 00:11:07.200
- Way to go, Hawlucha!
- Ha!

223
00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.900
Great job, Heliolisk. Take a good rest.

224
00:11:11.966 --> 00:11:13.633
You surprised me.

225
00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:16.266
I really thought I had you both on the ropes.

226
00:11:16.333 --> 00:11:18.200
Tell me what that opening you saw was.

227
00:11:18.266 --> 00:11:21.000
- Its frills.
- Huh. What about them?

228
00:11:21.066 --> 00:11:25.600
You see, every time Heliolisk uses an attack, it stops moving for a second.

229
00:11:25.666 --> 00:11:28.100
So all I had to do was watch and wait for that to happen!

230
00:11:28.166 --> 00:11:29.933
Oh!

231
00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.133
It happens really fast, but with Hawlucha's speed,

232
00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.566
we could pull it off.

233
00:11:34.633 --> 00:11:37.133
And then, Hawlucha's High Jump Kick did the rest.

234
00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:41.633
Oh! Very clever. As a Gym Leader, I thank you.

235
00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.733
That's a very good thing to remember.

236
00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.833
All right, then, Ash, my third and last Pokémon.

237
00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.766
Luxray, you're up!

238
00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:53.333
Luxray!

239
00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.666
So Clemont saved Luxray for last.

240
00:11:55.733 --> 00:11:57.133
- Pika.
- Hawlu.

241
00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.800
- Hawlucha, are you still OK?
- Cha!

242
00:11:59.866 --> 00:12:02.066
Yes!

243
00:12:02.133 --> 00:12:04.433
All right, use Flying Press!

244
00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.166
Ha! Lucha!

245
00:12:08.733 --> 00:12:11.666
- It hit!
- Luxray, Electric Terrain!

246
00:12:11.733 --> 00:12:14.433
Ray! Ray!

247
00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.600
Ray, ray, lux!

248
00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:21.900
Great strategy, son!

249
00:12:21.966 --> 00:12:25.200
Electric Terrain powers up all Electric-type moves

250
00:12:25.266 --> 00:12:28.133
- that are used on the battlefield!
- Nenne!

251
00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.400
Does that mean Luxray's got a big advantage?

252
00:12:30.466 --> 00:12:32.833
- That's right.
- That won't stop us!

253
00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.133
High Jump Kick!

254
00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.433
- Cha!
- Wild Charge, go!

255
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.933
Lux, lux, lux!

256
00:12:41.766 --> 00:12:43.066
Look at all that power!

257
00:12:43.133 --> 00:12:45.700
Electric Terrain made that Wild Charge even stronger!

258
00:12:45.766 --> 00:12:49.133
- That must have hurt.
- Cha!

259
00:12:50.566 --> 00:12:54.200
Hawlucha is unable to battle! Luxray is the winner!

260
00:12:54.266 --> 00:12:55.633
Luxray.

261
00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:59.133
- Way to go, Luxray! Heh.
- Pin! Che!

262
00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:02.000
With Electric Terrain... What will Ash do now?

263
00:13:02.066 --> 00:13:03.766
How will he battle at all?

264
00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:06.166
You were great, Hawlucha.

265
00:13:06.233 --> 00:13:09.233
You deserve a good rest! 'Kay, Pikachu?

266
00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.066
Pika, pika!

267
00:13:11.766 --> 00:13:13.066
Pikachu!

268
00:13:16.066 --> 00:13:18.766
All right! This battlefield's perfect!

269
00:13:18.833 --> 00:13:20.633
For both our Electric types!

270
00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.833
Now show me how you're going to use it to your advantage!

271
00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.866
Whatever you say! Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

272
00:13:27.933 --> 00:13:29.900
Pi! Pikachu!

273
00:13:29.966 --> 00:13:31.533
Luxray, Thunder Fang!

274
00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.566
Use it to bite into Pikachu's Thunderbolt!

275
00:13:33.633 --> 00:13:35.900
Ray! Lux!

276
00:13:35.966 --> 00:13:38.266
- Oh, no!
- Now use Wild Charge!

277
00:13:38.333 --> 00:13:40.233
Ray!

278
00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:45.100
- Lux! Luxray!
- Pika! Pika!

279
00:13:45.933 --> 00:13:47.533
Pi! Pika!

280
00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:49.766
- Swift, let's go!
- Lux!

281
00:13:49.833 --> 00:13:51.000
Ray!

282
00:13:51.066 --> 00:13:53.266
Knock it back with Iron Tail!

283
00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:55.866
Chu, pika!

284
00:13:57.233 --> 00:13:58.666
Pika. Pika.

285
00:13:58.733 --> 00:14:01.133
Now, Luxray. Use Wild Charge!

286
00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.766
Ray, ray, ray. Luxray!

287
00:14:03.833 --> 00:14:05.633
Pika!

288
00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.900
Pikachu is unable to battle. Luxray is the winner!

289
00:14:11.966 --> 00:14:14.133
-That's two Pokémon each...

290
00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.100
Pikachu! Oh!

291
00:14:16.933 --> 00:14:19.366
- Pi... Pikachu...
- Ah!

292
00:14:19.433 --> 00:14:21.900
Thanks, buddy. You go have a good rest.

293
00:14:26.966 --> 00:14:29.900
All right. Each of us has just one Pokémon left.

294
00:14:29.966 --> 00:14:32.100
This battle will decide the whole thing!

295
00:14:32.166 --> 00:14:34.900
No matter what happens, no hard feelings.

296
00:14:34.966 --> 00:14:36.633
Sure, but I'm gonna win!

297
00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.700
I'm really feeling conflicted.

298
00:14:39.766 --> 00:14:43.133
I want to give Ash a badge, but then again, I don't!

299
00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.766
I don't know how I feel.

300
00:14:44.833 --> 00:14:47.633
Except I want this battle to go on and on.

301
00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.800
Show me the real Ash, all the way to the final move!

302
00:14:52.033 --> 00:14:55.200
You can count on it! Goodra! I choose you!

303
00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:58.600
Goo!

304
00:14:58.666 --> 00:15:00.300
'Kay, let's do this!

305
00:15:00.366 --> 00:15:04.400
Even Pikachu couldn't win on this electric battlefield.

306
00:15:04.466 --> 00:15:08.633
Goodra must still feel that paralysis. We'll just see what happens!

307
00:15:10.166 --> 00:15:11.566
Clemont's right.

308
00:15:15.266 --> 00:15:18.333
Ah! So we'll make the battlefield work for us!

309
00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.866
- Huh.
- Use Rain Dance!

310
00:15:20.933 --> 00:15:24.033
Dra. goo!

311
00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:35.133
Of course! You made it rain to eliminate all the electricity!

312
00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:40.100
Clever boy. I'm afraid Clemont got outsmarted on that one.

313
00:15:40.166 --> 00:15:42.500
- How come?
- Dra?

314
00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.766
It's Goodra's Ability, Hydration.

315
00:15:44.833 --> 00:15:48.000
When it rains, it heals Goodra's status condition.

316
00:15:48.066 --> 00:15:52.000
- So you're saying Ash planned for that?
- It would seem so.

317
00:15:52.066 --> 00:15:53.100
- Now, Goodra!
- Goo?

318
00:15:53.166 --> 00:15:55.333
This is the perfect battlefield for you!

319
00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:58.366
- So give it everything you've got!
- Goodra!

320
00:15:58.433 --> 00:16:03.366
Ash's unpredictability wreaks havoc with my carefully laid plans.

321
00:16:03.433 --> 00:16:05.933
But I was waiting for this.

322
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:10.466
Ready? I'm going to play it by ear! Luxray! Swift, let's go!

323
00:16:10.533 --> 00:16:12.633
Luxray!

324
00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.366
Use your tail! Knock them back!

325
00:16:15.433 --> 00:16:18.466
- Goo! Goodra!
- Use Thunder Fang!

326
00:16:18.533 --> 00:16:20.466
This will be all over soon.

327
00:16:20.533 --> 00:16:22.866
Lux, lux, lux, Luxray!

328
00:16:22.933 --> 00:16:26.000
- Goodra, Bide!
- Dra, goo!

329
00:16:27.666 --> 00:16:29.400
What's Ash up to?

330
00:16:29.466 --> 00:16:31.700
I'm surprised he's taking such a passive stance.

331
00:16:31.766 --> 00:16:35.266
Goodra, goo!

332
00:16:35.333 --> 00:16:37.733
I want to keep battling some more!

333
00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:40.100
We'll just beat you before your energy's released!

334
00:16:40.166 --> 00:16:41.566
Now, Wild Charge, go!

335
00:16:41.633 --> 00:16:43.633
Lux, lux, lux, lux, lux!

336
00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.400
Luxray!

337
00:16:45.466 --> 00:16:48.733
- Pika, pika!
- All right, keep it going, Goodra!

338
00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:52.033
Still hanging on? In that case, use Swift!

339
00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.033
Luxray!

340
00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:58.666
- Goodra!
- It's still hanging in there.

341
00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.300
Dra!

342
00:17:01.366 --> 00:17:05.566
Man. I kind of wish we could keep this awesome battle going too.

343
00:17:05.633 --> 00:17:08.866
But it's time to win this and get my badge!

344
00:17:08.933 --> 00:17:11.366
Goodra, now let her rip!

345
00:17:11.433 --> 00:17:14.633
Goodra! Dra! Dra!

346
00:17:15.633 --> 00:17:17.733
Luxray!

347
00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.633
- Aaah!
- Luxray! Aah!

348
00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.966
Lux.

349
00:17:43.466 --> 00:17:47.033
Luxray is unable to battle! Goodra is the winner!

350
00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.900
Which means the match goes to Ash of Pallet Town!

351
00:17:50.966 --> 00:17:53.533
- We did it, Goodra! Ha-ha.
- Pika!

352
00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:57.266
Awesome! You were great!

353
00:17:57.333 --> 00:17:58.833
Goodra!

354
00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.300
- Pika, pika!
- Aww.

355
00:18:01.366 --> 00:18:02.600
Hm.

356
00:18:02.666 --> 00:18:06.100
- That was some battle, Goodra.
- Ash really won the match!

357
00:18:06.166 --> 00:18:09.566
Ah. Clemont and his Pokémon battled hard.

358
00:18:09.633 --> 00:18:11.600
He's an amazing big brother!

359
00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.666
Luxray, you were just great.

360
00:18:14.733 --> 00:18:15.833
Lux.

361
00:18:16.733 --> 00:18:20.800
Ash is incredible. I guess I still have a lot to learn.

362
00:18:20.866 --> 00:18:23.133
Thanks, Luxray!

363
00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.700
Hm.

364
00:18:29.733 --> 00:18:33.433
- Clemont, thanks a lot!
- I didn't do anything.

365
00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.300
Mm-mm. You made it lots of fun. What a great battle!

366
00:18:37.366 --> 00:18:39.433
Pikachu!

367
00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:42.133
- Congratulations, Ash!
- Hey thanks, Serena.

368
00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:45.233
Wow, I never ever saw you look so totally cool!

369
00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:50.400
-Ah. Clemont, that was a terrific battle!

370
00:18:50.466 --> 00:18:54.533
I'm so happy to see what a fine young man you've become!

371
00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:58.466
Well, Ash? We did what we said we'd do.

372
00:18:58.533 --> 00:19:00.600
I believe this is what you wanted!

373
00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.566
This is proof of your victory at the Lumiose Gym.

374
00:19:04.633 --> 00:19:07.100
- The Voltage Badge.
- Pika!

375
00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.800
All right! I got the Voltage Badge!

376
00:19:11.866 --> 00:19:13.300
Pi! Pikachu!

377
00:19:13.366 --> 00:19:15.966
So this is your fifth badge, isn't it?

378
00:19:16.033 --> 00:19:17.900
- Yup!
- You know what that means.

379
00:19:17.966 --> 00:19:21.933
Only three more badges, then you can finally enter the Kalos League!

380
00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.033
Right!

381
00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.433
So where are you going for your sixth badge?

382
00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.166
- Have you decided?
- No sir, not yet.

383
00:19:28.233 --> 00:19:31.266
- In that case, how about here?
- Huh?

384
00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.633
Ta-da! Laverre City! It'll be lots of fun!

385
00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:40.433
Ah. Yeah. Great! We're going to the Laverre City Gym!

386
00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:41.366
Pikachu.

387
00:19:41.433 --> 00:19:45.066
- Hey, son. You're going too, aren't you?
- Of course, Dad!

388
00:19:45.133 --> 00:19:49.266
Yippee! My big brother's travelling with us again!

389
00:19:49.333 --> 00:19:52.300
- Well, after all, you need me.
- Huh?

390
00:19:52.366 --> 00:19:54.600
Someone who's cool and calm.

391
00:19:54.666 --> 00:19:57.800
Don't forget, you can become quite the boisterous battler!

392
00:19:57.866 --> 00:19:59.500
- Pika?
- Guess you're right.

393
00:19:59.566 --> 00:20:02.300
Are you sure you wanna take a break from your gym?

394
00:20:02.366 --> 00:20:04.200
You have a great time.

395
00:20:04.266 --> 00:20:07.633
- Leave the gym to me.
- Thanks, Clembot.

396
00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:11.800
Let's continue on our journey together. All right?

397
00:20:11.866 --> 00:20:14.400
Deal! Great to have you back.

398
00:20:14.466 --> 00:20:16.133
- I'm in!
- Thanks!

399
00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.866
- Me too!
- Me too! Me too!

400
00:20:18.933 --> 00:20:19.933
Denne-ne!

401
00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.366
We're one happy family! Together forever!

402
00:20:23.433 --> 00:20:26.833
- Oh!
- Bonnie! Serena! Clemont!

403
00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:29.100
- Here we go!
- Pika, pika!

404
00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:31.600
- Yeah!
- Denne-ne!

405
00:20:31.666 --> 00:20:33.900
With Ash's Gym Battle against Clemont

406
00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:36.700
resulting in his fifth Kalos Gym Badge,

407
00:20:36.766 --> 00:20:41.900
and with three badges left for him to earn, our heroes' journey continues!
